{"unit_id":"linke-e__dsh-opening-animation#feature-1","repo":"linke-e/dsh-opening-animation","commit":"ed7b0620fb77e02550846fe3577f3978c66e8902","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-opening-animation 的功能「导入开场媒体」：在设置页添加图片或视频到本地媒体库。插件会检查媒体类型、大小和可解码性，并将条目写入 IndexedDB；媒体库最多保存 8 项。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/controller.ts:231-280","src/client/media-store.ts:20-28","src/client/ui/OpeningSection.tsx:90-96"]}
